{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13174","headline":"太常魏博士远出贼庭江外相逢因叙其事 · 皇甫冉","name":"太常魏博士远出贼庭江外相逢因叙其事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烽火惊戎塞，豺狼犯帝畿。\n川原无稼穑，日月翳光辉。\n里社枌榆毁，宫城骑吏非。\n羣生被惨毒，杂虏耀轻肥。\n多士从芳饵，唯君识祸机。\n心同合浦叶，命寄首阳薇。\n耻作纤鳞喣，方随高鸟飞。\n山经商岭出，水泛汉池归。\n离别霜凝鬓，逢迎泪迸衣。\n京华长路绝，江海故人稀。\n秉节身常苦，求仁志不违。\n秪应穷野外，耕种且相依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}